# Line-ending policy for the in-repo engine tree.
#
# This file EXISTS AND MATTERS: a deeper .gitattributes wins per-attribute, so this
# governs every path under engine/ (1800+ .cs files and all packaging artwork) and
# the repo-root .gitattributes cannot reach them. Keep the two in sync.
#
# Previously `* text=lf`, which is a no-op — `lf` is not a valid `text` value.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats — pinned explicitly so content auto-detection can never misfire on
# a game asset or an image. This is NOT belt-and-braces: engine/packaging/artwork
# PNGs legitimately contain CR bytes (ra_16x16.png is 632 bytes with 5 CRs), and
# normalizing one strips a byte and corrupts the image.
*.shp binary
*.aud binary
*.des binary
*.jun binary
*.tem binary
*.sno binary
*.int binary
*.tmp binary
*.pal binary
*.bin binary
*.mix binary
*.dat binary
*.win binary
*.oramap binary
*.a00 binary
*.a01 binary
*.a02 binary
*.a03 binary
*.png binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary

# Custom for Visual Studio
*.cs     diff=csharp
